{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea4bd2e6615462be1fbd31e5b8fe5e5464ff3e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^{2}+5-8x=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"132\" height=\"16\" /> is equal to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7fab3059701afb7eb7e6a8a67b4e5a9a022650b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -5\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ -\\frac{5}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ -2\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"509\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can divide by 4 to get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/8/ed861820dbfb645c0fb03551196e82030073b988.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2}-2x+\\dfrac{5}{4}=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"131\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The Vieta's formula states that in quadratic equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d13ac0e00358ad3fa8b0d6db3217b8a10cc7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />, the sum of the roots of the equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/b/d1b848e82a6f7ef8135636b57ab2da5825a55b61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"26\" height=\"37\" />.\nUsing Vieta's formula, we find that the roots add to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/d/c2dcc47ef0a92a9d8052df602b1e753b3f162867.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can divide by 4 to get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/8/ed861820dbfb645c0fb03551196e82030073b988.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2}-2x+\\dfrac{5}{4}=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"131\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>By using quadratic formula you can find the roots are \\(x=\\frac{8\\pm \\sqrt{-16}}{8}\\) adding the roots together to get 2.\n</p><p>or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/d/c2dcc47ef0a92a9d8052df602b1e753b3f162867.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~samma\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b